{"id":"math-001","subject":"math","grade":"middle_school","problem_type":"equation_solving","question_format":"written_solution","text":"解方程 x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0。","answer":"故 x = 2 或 x = 3。","solution":"因式分解得 (x-2)(x-3)=0，所以 x=2 或 x=3。","checks":[{"kind":"equation_substitution","equation":"x**2-5*x+6=0","assignments":{"x":"2"}},{"kind":"equation_substitution","equation":"x**2-5*x+6=0","assignments":{"x":"3"}}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["algebra","quadratic"]}
{"id":"math-002","subject":"math","grade":"middle_school","problem_type":"equation_solving","question_format":"written_solution","text":"解方程 2x + 3 = 11。","answer":"故 x = 4。","solution":"移项得 2x=8，所以 x=4。","checks":[{"kind":"equation_substitution","equation":"2*x+3=11","assignments":{"x":"4"}}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["algebra","linear"]}
{"id":"math-003","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"equation_solving","question_format":"written_solution","text":"解方程 x^2 - 4 = 0。","answer":"故 x = 2 或 x = -2。","solution":"(x-2)(x+2)=0，所以 x=±2。","checks":[{"kind":"equation_substitution","equation":"x**2-4=0","assignments":{"x":"2"}},{"kind":"equation_substitution","equation":"x**2-4=0","assignments":{"x":"-2"}}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["algebra"]}
{"id":"math-004","subject":"math","grade":"middle_school","problem_type":"equation_solving","question_format":"written_solution","text":"解方程 3x^2 - 12x + 9 = 0。","answer":"故 x = 1 或 x = 3。","solution":"两边除以 3 得 x^2-4x+3=0，因式分解得 (x-1)(x-3)=0。","checks":[{"kind":"equation_substitution","equation":"3*x**2-12*x+9=0","assignments":{"x":"1"}},{"kind":"equation_substitution","equation":"3*x**2-12*x+9=0","assignments":{"x":"3"}}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["algebra"]}
{"id":"math-005","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"equation_solving","question_format":"written_solution","text":"解方程 sqrt(x + 3) = 2。","answer":"故 x = 1。","solution":"两边平方得 x+3=4，所以 x=1，检验成立。","checks":[{"kind":"equation_substitution","equation":"sqrt(x+3)=2","assignments":{"x":"1"}}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["radical"]}
{"id":"math-006","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"trigonometry","question_format":"written_solution","text":"证明恒等式 sin(2x) = 2 sin x cos x。","answer":"故 sin(2x) = 2 sin x cos x。","solution":"由和角公式 sin(x+x)=sin x cos x + cos x sin x = 2 sin x cos x。","checks":[{"kind":"identity","lhs":"sin(2*x)","rhs":"2*sin(x)*cos(x)"}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"coordinate","has_figure":false,"tags":["trigonometry","identity"]}
{"id":"math-007","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"calculus","question_format":"written_solution","text":"求函数 f(x) = x^3 - 3x 的导数。","answer":"故 f'(x) = 3x^2 - 3。","solution":"逐项求导得 f'(x)=3x^2-3。","checks":[{"kind":"derivative","expression":"x**3-3*x","variable":"x","claimed":"3*x**2-3"}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"function","has_figure":false,"tags":["calculus","derivative"]}
{"id":"math-008","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"calculus","question_format":"written_solution","text":"求不定积分 ∫ 2x dx。","answer":"故 ∫2x dx = x^2 + C。","solution":"由幂函数积分公式得 x^2+C。","checks":[{"kind":"integral","expression":"2*x","variable":"x","claimed":"x**2"}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"function","has_figure":false,"tags":["calculus","integral"]}
{"id":"math-009","subject":"math","grade":"middle_school","problem_type":"other","question_format":"fill_blank","text":"计算 2^10 的值。","answer":"故 2^10 = 1024。","solution":"2^10=1024。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"2**10","expected":"1024","tolerance":1e-9}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["arithmetic"]}
{"id":"math-010","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"other","question_format":"fill_blank","text":"计算 log_2 8 的值。","answer":"故 log_2 8 = 3。","solution":"因为 2^3=8，所以 log_2 8=3。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"log(8)/log(2)","expected":"3","tolerance":1e-9}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["logarithm"]}
{"id":"math-011","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"probability_statistics","question_format":"fill_blank","text":"从 5 个不同元素中任取 2 个，共有多少种取法？","answer":"故共有 10 种取法。","solution":"C(5,2)=10。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"binomial(5,2)","expected":"10","tolerance":1e-9}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["combinatorics"]}
{"id":"math-012","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"analytic_geometry","question_format":"fill_blank","text":"求点 A(0,0) 与点 B(3,4) 之间的距离。","answer":"故 |AB| = 5。","solution":"由两点间距离公式得 sqrt(3^2+4^2)=5。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"sqrt(3**2+4**2)","expected":"5","tolerance":1e-9}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"coordinate","has_figure":false,"tags":["distance"]}
{"id":"math-013","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"analytic_geometry","question_format":"fill_blank","text":"求点 A(0,0) 与点 B(4,2) 连线的中点坐标。","answer":"故中点坐标为 (2, 1)。","solution":"中点横坐标为 (0+4)/2=2，纵坐标为 (0+2)/2=1。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"(0+4)/2","expected":"2","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"numeric","expression":"(0+2)/2","expected":"1","tolerance":1e-9}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"coordinate","has_figure":false,"tags":["midpoint"]}
{"id":"math-014","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"analytic_geometry","question_format":"fill_blank","text":"求经过点 A(1,2) 和 B(3,6) 的直线的斜率。","answer":"故斜率 k = 2。","solution":"k=(6-2)/(3-1)=2。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"(6-2)/(3-1)","expected":"2","tolerance":1e-9}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"coordinate","has_figure":false,"tags":["slope"]}
{"id":"math-015","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"analytic_geometry","question_format":"written_solution","text":"判断点 P(3,4) 是否在圆 x^2 + y^2 = 25 上。","answer":"故点 P 在圆上。","solution":"3^2+4^2=25，等于半径的平方，故点在圆上。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"3**2+4**2","expected":"25","tolerance":1e-9}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"coordinate","has_figure":false,"tags":["circle"]}
{"id":"math-016","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"trigonometry","question_format":"written_solution","text":"在三角形中，a=b=5，C=60°，求 c^2。","answer":"故 c^2 = 25。","solution":"由余弦定理 c^2=a^2+b^2-2ab cos C=25+25-50×0.5=25。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"5**2+5**2-2*5*5*cos(pi/3)","expected":"25","tolerance":1e-9}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"coordinate","has_figure":false,"tags":["cosine_rule"]}
{"id":"math-017","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"trigonometry","question_format":"written_solution","text":"解方程 sin x = 1/2，x 属于 [0, 2π]。","answer":"故 x = π/6 或 x = 5π/6。","solution":"由单位圆得两个解 π/6 与 5π/6。","checks":[{"kind":"equation_substitution","equation":"sin(x)=1/2","assignments":{"x":"pi/6"}},{"kind":"equation_substitution","equation":"sin(x)=1/2","assignments":{"x":"5*pi/6"}}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"coordinate","has_figure":false,"tags":["trig_equation"]}
{"id":"math-018","subject":"math","grade":"middle_school","problem_type":"geometry_proof","question_format":"proof","text":"如图，在△ABC 中，AB=AC，D 是 BC 的中点。求证：AD⊥BC。","answer":"故 AD⊥BC。","solution":"由 AB=AC，BD=CD，AD=AD 得 △ABD≌△ACD（SSS），故 ∠ADB=∠ADC；又 B、D、C 共线，所以 ∠ADB=∠ADC=90°，即 AD⊥BC。","checks":[],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"geometry","has_figure":true,"tags":["geometry","proof"]}
{"id":"math-019","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"function_analysis","question_format":"written_solution","text":"求函数 y = x^2 - 2x - 3 的顶点坐标与零点。","answer":"故顶点为 (1, -4)，零点为 x=-1 和 x=3。","solution":"配方得 y=(x-1)^2-4，顶点 (1,-4)；令 y=0 得 x=-1 或 x=3。","checks":[{"kind":"equation_substitution","equation":"x**2-2*x-3=0","assignments":{"x":"-1"}},{"kind":"equation_substitution","equation":"x**2-2*x-3=0","assignments":{"x":"3"}},{"kind":"numeric","expression":"1**2-2*1-3","expected":"-4","tolerance":1e-9}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"function","has_figure":false,"tags":["function","vertex"]}
{"id":"math-020","subject":"math","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"function_analysis","question_format":"written_solution","text":"请画出函数 y = x^2 - 2x - 3 的图象，并写出它的顶点坐标。","answer":"故顶点为 (1, -4)，图象为开口向上的抛物线。","solution":"配方得 y=(x-1)^2-4，顶点 (1,-4)，与 x 轴交于 (-1,0)、(3,0)。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"1**2-2*1-3","expected":"-4","tolerance":1e-9}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"function","has_figure":false,"tags":["function","drawing"]}
{"id":"phys-001","subject":"physics","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"dynamics","question_format":"written_solution","text":"质量 m=2kg 的物块在粗糙水平面上受到水平拉力 F=10N 作用，动摩擦因数 μ=0.2，g 取 10m/s^2。求物块运动的加速度。","answer":"故 a = 3 m/s^2，方向水平向右。","solution":"受力分析：N=mg=20N，f=μN=4N，合力 F-f=6N，由 F=ma 得 a=3m/s^2。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"(10-0.2*2*10)/2","expected":"3","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"unit_check","value":"3","unit":"m/s^2","dimension":"acceleration"}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"force","has_figure":false,"tags":["newton","friction"]}
{"id":"phys-002","subject":"physics","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"kinematics","question_format":"written_solution","text":"汽车从静止开始以 2 m/s^2 的加速度匀加速行驶，求 5 s 后的速度。","answer":"故 v = 10 m/s。","solution":"由 v=u+at=0+2×5=10m/s。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"0+2*5","expected":"10","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"unit_check","value":"10","unit":"m/s","dimension":"velocity"}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["kinematics"]}
{"id":"phys-003","subject":"physics","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"kinematics","question_format":"written_solution","text":"物体从静止开始以 2 m/s^2 的加速度匀加速运动，求 5 s 内的位移。","answer":"故 s = 25 m。","solution":"由 s=ut+at^2/2=0.5×2×25=25m。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"0.5*2*5**2","expected":"25","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"unit_check","value":"25","unit":"m","dimension":"length"}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["kinematics"]}
{"id":"phys-004","subject":"physics","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"dynamics","question_format":"written_solution","text":"对质量 m=2kg 的物体进行受力分析，它受到 6N 的水平合力，求加速度。","answer":"故 a = 3 m/s^2。","solution":"由牛顿第二定律 a=F/m=6/2=3m/s^2。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"6/2","expected":"3","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"unit_check","value":"3","unit":"m/s^2","dimension":"acceleration"}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"force","has_figure":false,"tags":["newton"]}
{"id":"phys-005","subject":"physics","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"work_energy","question_format":"written_solution","text":"用水平拉力 F=10N 拉着物块沿水平方向移动 3m，求拉力做的功。","answer":"故 W = 30 J。","solution":"W=Fs=10×3=30J。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"10*3","expected":"30","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"unit_check","value":"30","unit":"J","dimension":"energy"}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"force","has_figure":false,"tags":["work"]}
{"id":"phys-006","subject":"physics","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"work_energy","question_format":"written_solution","text":"拉力在 5s 内做功 30J，求拉力的平均功率。","answer":"故 P = 6 W。","solution":"P=W/t=30/5=6W。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"30/5","expected":"6","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"unit_check","value":"6","unit":"W","dimension":"power"}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"force","has_figure":false,"tags":["power"]}
{"id":"phys-007","subject":"physics","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"momentum","question_format":"written_solution","text":"质量 2kg 的物体以 10m/s 的速度运动，求它的动量大小。","answer":"故 p = 20 kg·m/s。","solution":"p=mv=2×10=20kg·m/s。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"2*10","expected":"20","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"unit_check","value":"20","unit":"kg·m/s","dimension":"momentum"}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["momentum"]}
{"id":"phys-008","subject":"physics","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"work_energy","question_format":"written_solution","text":"质量 2kg 的物块以 10m/s 运动，求它的动能。","answer":"故 E_k = 100 J。","solution":"E_k=mv^2/2=2×100/2=100J。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"2*10**2/2","expected":"100","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"unit_check","value":"100","unit":"J","dimension":"energy"}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["kinetic_energy"]}
{"id":"phys-009","subject":"physics","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"circuit","question_format":"written_solution","text":"如图所示的电路中，电阻 R=3Ω，通过它的电流 I=2A，求电阻两端的电压。","answer":"故 U = 6 V。","solution":"由欧姆定律 U=IR=2×3=6V。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"2*3","expected":"6","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"unit_check","value":"6","unit":"V","dimension":"voltage"}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"circuit","has_figure":true,"tags":["ohm"]}
{"id":"phys-010","subject":"physics","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"circuit","question_format":"written_solution","text":"如图，电阻两端电压为 6V，通过电阻的电流为 0.5A，求电阻阻值。","answer":"故 R = 12 Ω。","solution":"由 R=U/I=6/0.5=12Ω。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"6/0.5","expected":"12","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"unit_check","value":"12","unit":"Ω","dimension":"resistance"}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"circuit","has_figure":true,"tags":["ohm"]}
{"id":"phys-011","subject":"physics","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"optics","question_format":"written_solution","text":"光在真空中的速度为 3×10^8 m/s，在某介质中的速度为 2×10^8 m/s，求该介质的折射率。","answer":"故 n = 1.5。","solution":"n=c/v=3×10^8/(2×10^8)=1.5。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"3*10**8/(2*10**8)","expected":"1.5","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"unit_check","value":"1.5","unit":"1","dimension":"dimensionless"}],"needs_diagram":true,"diagram_type":"optics","has_figure":false,"tags":["refraction"]}
{"id":"phys-012","subject":"physics","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"dynamics","question_format":"written_solution","text":"质量 m=2kg 的物体放在水平面上，g=10m/s^2，求它受到的重力。","answer":"故重力 G = 20 N。","solution":"G=mg=2×10=20N。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"2*10","expected":"20","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"unit_check","value":"20","unit":"N","dimension":"force"}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["gravity"]}
{"id":"phys-013","subject":"physics","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"circuit","question_format":"written_solution","text":"通过导体的电流为 2A，通电时间为 3s，求通过导体横截面的电荷量。","answer":"故 Q = 6 C。","solution":"Q=It=2×3=6C。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"2*3","expected":"6","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"unit_check","value":"6","unit":"C","dimension":"charge"}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["charge"]}
{"id":"phys-014","subject":"physics","grade":"high_school","problem_type":"waves","question_format":"written_solution","text":"一列波的周期为 0.5s，求它的频率。","answer":"故 f = 2 Hz。","solution":"f=1/T=1/0.5=2Hz。","checks":[{"kind":"numeric","expression":"1/0.5","expected":"2","tolerance":1e-9},{"kind":"unit_check","value":"2","unit":"Hz","dimension":"frequency"}],"needs_diagram":false,"diagram_type":"none","has_figure":false,"tags":["frequency"]}
